{"version":1,"content":"<p>今天上午，國務院總理李強在浙江烏鎮出席2026年世界互聯網大會烏鎮峰會開幕式並發表主旨演講。</p><p>他表示，反對構築「數字鐵幕」，中國將支持全球南方國家建設數字基礎設施、提升數字技術能力。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:22:33.781021+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:48:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:22.629594+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:18:21.658000+00:00","content_hash":"a7b3a2ddd2f6379468a301a874557b02cfd7433b0181eb22034a6f72a9719fe2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}